      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00335",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "\"唉，你没有别的寺庙了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Ah, you have no other temple now.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00335",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "你除了当这金阁寺的住持以外，没有别的出路了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "You have no way forward except to become the abbot of this Kinkakuji.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00335",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "你要博得老师的欢喜，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "You must win your teacher's favor,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00335",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "要成为他的接班人，明白吧？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and become his successor, do you understand?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00335",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "这是妈妈活着的惟一指望啊！\"",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "That is your mother's only hope in life!\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
